  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with a generous drizzle of olive oil.\n• When oil is hot, cook gnocchi, tossing occasionally, until golden, 6-8 minutes.\n• TIP: If needed, add extra oil so the gnocchi doesn’t stick to the pan!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f870fbcade9b9f0acf06cc/step-daa15400.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, halve snacking tomatoes.\n• Finely chop garlic.\n• Trim baby broccoli, halving any thicker stalks lengthways.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f870fbcade9b9f0acf06cc/step-5b9dae10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a second large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook snacking tomatoes, until slightly blistered, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add garlic and garlic & herb seasoning and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Stir in diced tomatoes with garlic & onion, a pinch of chilli flakes (if using) and the brown sugar until combined, 1-2 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f870fbcade9b9f0acf06cc/step-a8432c20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, preheat grill to high.\n• Remove frying pan from heat and stir through half the ricotta, the salt and cooked gnocchi until combined. Season with pepper.\n• Transfer pasta mixture to a baking dish and sprinkle with Cheddar cheese and remaining ricotta.\n• Grill until cheese is melted and golden, 8-10 minutes.\n• TIP: Grills cook fast, so keep an eye on the pasta!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f870fbcade9b9f0acf06cc/step-0dbdb930.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While pasta is baking, wipe out a frying pan and return to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook baby broccoli, until tender, 5-6 minutes.\n• Transfer to a medium bowl and allow to cool slightly.\n• Once broccoli has cooled slightly, to the bowl, add spinach & rocket mix and balsamic vinaigrette dressing. Toss to combine. Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f870fbcade9b9f0acf06cc/step-eed6fe40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Sprinkle flaked almonds over salad.\n• Divide cheesy cherry tomato and ricotta pasta bake between bowls.\n• Serve with baby broccoli salad. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f870fbcade9b9f0acf06cc/step-1069f150.jpg"
    }
  ]
